<title>USA: Stratasys to buy back 300,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Stratasys to buy back 300,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stratasys Inc said Tuesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 300,000 shares from time to time in the open market during 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock repurchase program reflects Stratasys's strong financial position as well as the board's confidence in the company's continued growth prospects,&quot; Scott Crump, president, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Stratasys makes rapid prototyping systems for automotive, aerospace, industrial, electronic, medical and consumer products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
